"    * Native Jalali Datepicker for date and datetime fields.\n"
"    * Compatibility with Odoo 19 Enterprise and Community editions.\n"
"    * Support for Gantt, Calendar, and Cohort views.\n"
"\n"
"    Note: This module requires a commercial license for use in production environments.\n"
"\n"
